{
  "job_B15.8.580_20260920_210344": {
    "text": "\u00c6rest up of Temese, andlang Merfleotes to Pollene stocce.\nSwa on Bulinga fenn, of tham fenne \u00e6fter th\u00e6r ealdan dic to Cuforde.\nUpp andlang Teoburnan to th\u00e6re wide herestret, \u00e6fter there herestret to th\u00e6re ealde stoccene sancte\nSwa innan Lundane fenn, andlang fennes suth on Temese on middan streame.\nAndlang streame be lande & be strande eft on Merfleote.\n\u00c6rest \u00e6t Sandg\u00e6te th\u00e6r tha threo marce to g\u00e6dere gath, west thanon andlang Hemstedes mearce to\nAndlang burnan to W\u00e6tlingan str\u00e6te, andlang str\u00e6te into Br\u00e6ingte.\nUp andlang Br\u00e6gente innan fihte burnan, of tham burnan to tham wogan \u00e6psan.\nThanon to tham \u00e6ldan hagtreowe, of tham treowe to tham thrim m\u00e6rcum \u00e6t Sandgate.\n\u00c6rest \u00e6t Sandg\u00e6te, swa east to bedegares swicleage, th\u00e6r suth to Deormodes wican.\nOf Deormodes wican to medeman Hemstede, swa forth &lang hagan to risc leage.\nOf risc leage west \u00e6fter m\u00e6rce to tham b\u00e6ruwe, of tham b\u00e6rue west andlang m\u00e6rce to stangrave.\nOf tham grave innan W\u00e6tlinga str\u00e6te, swa north &lang w\u00e6tlinge str\u00e6te to m\u00e6r burne.\nOf m\u00e6r burnan of east \u00e6fter mearce to sandg\u00e6te.",
